This directory holds the productions of the @anon14none YouTube channel
(https://www.youtube.com/@anon14none):

  agentic-ai-intro          Episode 01: What is Agentic AI?
  ep02-inside-the-agent     Episode 02: Inside an AI Agent: Who Actually Runs the Loop?
  ep03-context-and-memory   Episode 03: Context and Memory: How an Agent Handles Long Tasks
  ep04-planning             Episode 04: Planning: How an Agent Handles Big Goals
  demo-tool-call            What is a tool call? (smoke test)

and any later production that anon14none adds to this repository. It covers everything in
those folders: scripts, production plans, notes, narration in every language, scene code
(including scenes/thumbnail.py and the production kits such as memory_kit.py and
plan_kit.py) and production settings. It also covers everything rendered from them: the
videos, voice-overs, subtitles, thumbnails, chapters and topic lists.

